* The '''[[Okaiken|Sanese]]''' coalition government collapses after major gaffes involving the handling of '''[[Nakayama Station dragging incident]]''' (''HM170 Series involved in the accident pictured''); Okaiken Transit Workers Union declares an indefinite strike on the [[Okaiken Railways]] network unless Prime Minister [[Shigetsuma Honda]] resigns.
* '''[[Yanbaru]]''' announces plans to connect its capital '''Yomitan''' with a high speed rail line that will connect to the [[Harujima Shinkansen]] in Shinagawa.
* '''[[Hancil Thea]]''' is sworn in as the Leader of the Burawi People after an [[2025 Burawa Leadership Elections|upset victory]] of a minority party.
* The '''Rovian Federation''''s annexation of territories near '''Port Vane''' triggers a joint emergency session of the Adonian Community, with members debating a unified military response.
* In sports, the '''Okami Steelers''' secure a last-minute victory in the Okaiken Rugby League One finals.

